# Hidden Strings untaps one target before tapping a different target, then can encode onto a creature (CR 701.21, 702.99).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Island
Ornithopter
Hidden Strings
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hidden Strings.Cast
! Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Untap)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Modes(Tap)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Exile = Hidden Strings
